  engContent: "\r\nNOTE > TRANSLATED FROM MULTIPLE HANDWRITTEN SOURCES\r\n\r\n\"Nobody
    remembers what we did wrong.  \r\nNot clearly.  \r\nBut every spring, someone
    disappears,  \r\nand every night the sea returns what should have stayed forgotten.\"\r\n\r\n\"Old
    fishermen still tie knots before dawn.  \r\nThey say it's for protection.  \r\nBut
    when asked from what, they only smile.  \r\nSome smile too wide.\"\r\n\r\n\"Something
    is watching beneath the sea.  \r\nan idea that we failed to face.\"\r\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\r"
